# The model library itself is ~18 GB of vendor STLs and slicer projects.
# Only the tracker, its reference data and its generated dashboard are versioned.
*.stl
*.lys
*.ctp
*.chitubox
*.pdf
*.jpg
# The vendor's .webp/.avif logo renders are deliberately NOT ignored: GitHub
# Pages needs them in the repo to show the dashboard to Brian, and the webp is
# 1000x1000 at ~11 KB, smaller than the ignored Release_*.jpg photos.
*.png
# ...but keep the cached build-plate previews: the .goo they come from is
# eventually deleted off the printer, so these become the only record of
# what a plate held.
!plates/
!plates/*.png
*_autosave/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.log

# UVtools ships as a 267 MB linux-x64 bundle; it is a tool we run, not
# something this repo should carry.
uvtools/
